 ## Model
 
-The app uses this model package:
+The app offers two separate model packages:
 
-- `qwen-tokenizer-12hz-Q4_K_M.gguf`
-- `qwen-talker-0.6b-base-Q4_K_M.gguf`
+- Q4_K_M: `qwen-tokenizer-12hz-Q4_K_M.gguf` and `qwen-talker-0.6b-base-Q4_K_M.gguf` (about 844 MiB)
+- Q8_0: `qwen-tokenizer-12hz-Q8_0.gguf` and `qwen-talker-0.6b-base-Q8_0.gguf` (about 1.20 GiB)
+
+Both variants generated the same short Russian phrase on Galaxy S24 Ultra. Q4_K_M
+took 97.879 seconds for 1.60 seconds of audio; Q8_0 took 124.254 seconds for
+1.28 seconds of audio. Voice quality still needs a listening comparison. The
+packages use separate directories so loading one variant cannot silently
+select the other variant's tokenizer.
 
 Model files are downloaded from
 [`Serveurperso/Qwen3-TTS-GGUF`](https://huggingface.co/Serveurperso/Qwen3-TTS-GGUF)
